| **pip install from PyPI** | Free-installation | `pip install mcp-business-central-server` or `uv pip install mcp-business-central-server` |
| **Local Development** | Local deployment | Clone repo → Create venv → `pip install -e .` → Run with `python -m mcp_bc_server` |
| **Remote Deployment** | Not Available | No remote deployment option mentioned |

