## 1.1 Platform Analysis

This MCP server is designed to work with DaVinci Resolve through its Python API. DaVinci Resolve is available on Linux, Windows, and macOS. The README does not specify any platform restrictions that would prevent Linux deployment. **This server can be deployed on Linux.**

